menu "ESP32 CTF"

config CTF_SIZE_PROBE
    bool "Link BT/Wi-Fi/HTTP/mDNS stubs to measure image size"
    default n
    help
        Development only. Adds calls into Bluedroid (BLE GATTS + Classic SPP),
        Wi-Fi, esp_http_server and mdns so the linker keeps those stacks and
        `idf.py size` reflects the final firmware footprint. The calls are
        never executed. Leave disabled.

endmenu
